    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 65；''重伤'' 32</span><span>''先攻'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 15，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 11</span><span>''侦查'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">伏击</div>\n<div class=description>该熊地精对没有盟友与之邻接的生物的攻击骰获得+4 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}钉头锤（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：2d8+6 伤害，若该熊地精对目标拥有战斗优势则为 3d8+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}手斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+12</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+7）</span><span>''敏捷'' 20（+7）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，地精语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，钉头锤，2 把手斧</span></div></div>\n</div>",
